 \, paid in Q4 2027.\n\nOrganisation: Zinegoak\, Bilbao International LGTBI
 QA+ Film and Performing Arts Festival\nLocation: Bilbao\, Spain. Festival 
 21 to 29 June 2027. Films from any country.\nAward: Grand Prix best featur
 e EUR 4\,000\; Diversity and Human Rights Award EUR 3\,000\; Lesbianism an
 d Gender Award EUR 3\,000\; Audience Award best short EUR 1\,000. Prizes a
 re taxed and split 50/50 with a Spanish distributor where one exists. No e
 ntry fee stated.\nDuration: Festival 21 to 29 June 2027\n\nMore: https://z
 inegoak.com/en/izen-ematea/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medi
