SUMMARY:Deadline 20:00 EST: SSHRC Insight Development Grants\, February 202
 7 competition (research-creation eligible)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 02 Feb 2027 at 20:00 EST.\n\nInsight Development Grants 
 fund short-term research in the early stages\, including new questions\, a
 pproaches and methods\, across all SSHRC disciplines\, and SSHRC explicitl
 y welcomes research-creation\, so artist-researchers working on digital cu
 lture\, media arts\, AI and technology can apply.\n\nOrganisation: Social 
 Sciences and Humanities Research Council of Canada (SSHRC)\nLocation: Cana
 da. Applicants must be affiliated with an eligible Canadian postsecondary 
 institution.\nAward: CAD 10\,000 to 100\,000 over 1 to 2 years\; at least 
 50% of funds reserved for emerging scholars. No application fee.\nDuration
 : 1 to 2 years\n\nMore: https://sshrc-crsh.canada.ca/en/funding/opportunit
 ies/insight-development-grants/2027/competition.aspx?utm_source=artificial
 nouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
