DESCRIPTION:A production prize for a new\, unrealised film\, video or media
  installation\, open only to AdBK München final-year students (graduating
  within six months) and graduates up to two years out. The winning work is
  shown at the AkademieGalerie and acquired for the Sammlung Goetz. Email a
 pplications to medienkunstpreis@sammlung-goetz.de by 20 November 2026.\n\n
 Organisation: Kunststiftung Ingvild und Stephan Goetz\, Sammlung Goetz and
  Akademie der Bildenden Künste München\nLocation: Munich\, Germany. AdBK
  München students and recent graduates only.\nAward: EUR 5\,000 productio
 n budget\, plus an exhibition at the AkademieGalerie\; the work enters the
  Goetz collection. No application fee.\nDuration: Work to be completed by 
 end of July 2027\n\nMore: https://www.sammlung-goetz.de/assets/sammlung-go
 etz/Bilder_und_Dokumente/News/2026/Ausschreibung_Medienkunstpreis_2027_DE.
 pdf?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
